# PROJECT: ROYAL EPIC LOANS – COMPLETE WEBSITE AND CRM INTEGRATION

## 1. PROJECT BACKGROUND

We need to introduce a new business vertical called **Royal Epic Loans** into the existing Royal Epic Interiors website ecosystem.

Main website:
[https://royalepicinterior.com/](https://royalepicinterior.com/)

Existing Telecaller CRM:
[https://tele.royalepicinterior.com/](https://tele.royalepicinterior.com/)

The existing website already has a separate Properties vertical. We now want to introduce Loans as another independent vertical, following a similar architectural approach where appropriate.

### Business model

Royal Epic receives finance enquiries from customers who need financial assistance for:

- Home construction
- Home interiors
- Home renovation
- Modular kitchens and furnishing projects
- Other eligible property-related requirements

Royal Epic's team collects the enquiry, understands the customer's requirements, performs an initial review and personally contacts the customer to discuss the next steps.

Depending on the customer's requirements and applicable eligibility, suitable finance options may subsequently be explored.

IMPORTANT BUSINESS CONFIDENTIALITY:

Do not disclose on the public website that Royal Epic works with third-party loan providers, lending partners or referral partners.

Do not display partner names, internal arrangements, commissions, referral procedures or backend business relationships.

The website should simply present Royal Epic Loans as a professional finance enquiry assistance and customer guidance service.

Do not falsely represent Royal Epic as a bank, NBFC or direct lender.

Do not promise guaranteed loan approval, guaranteed interest rates, guaranteed amounts or guaranteed disbursement.

